d70ea7a0 (Aryan Gupta            2026-09-05 13:28:08 +0530    1) # Claw
6f49427b (Aryan Gupta            2026-09-04 11:08:12 +0530    2) 
d70ea7a0 (Aryan Gupta            2026-09-05 13:28:08 +0530    3) A lightweight terminal text editor written entirely in C.
6f49427b (Aryan Gupta            2026-09-04 11:08:12 +0530    4) 
d70ea7a0 (Aryan Gupta            2026-09-05 13:28:08 +0530    5) Claw is being developed as part of a larger project to build a Linux-based operating system from scratch. The goal is to create a fast, modular, and extensible text editor while remaining simple, lightweight, and easy to understand.
