f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  582) If no filename has been set (opened with `./claw`), a Save-As prompt appears:
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  583) 
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  584) ```text
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  585) Save as: _
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  586) ```
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  587) 
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  588) Type the desired filename and press Enter. The file is saved and subsequent
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  589) Ctrl+S saves directly without prompting. Press Escape to cancel.
f0d52595 (Official-Pranavchauhan 2026-09-10 10:09:37 +0530  590) 
