cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  597) ### Navigate Search Results
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  598) 
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  599) ```text
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  600) Ctrl + N    Next Match
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  601) Ctrl + P    Previous Match
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  602) ```
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  603) 
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  604) ### Replace Current Match
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  605) 
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  606) ```text
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  607) Ctrl + R
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  608) Enter replacement text
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  609) Press Enter
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  610) ```
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  611) 
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  612) The current match is replaced and the cursor automatically moves to the next match.
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  613) 
cc0e3511 (aryangupta-tech        2026-09-09 21:56:13 +0530  614) ### Replace All Matches
